// 0.25.3 (eval 0.25.2.2): `{s}` of a slice says why it has no Display and
// what writes it ('{s:?}', which works since 0.25.3); `{s:?}` of a slice
// whose elements have no Debug names the element type.
// ERROR: error[type error]: '&[i64]' does not implement Display, which '{x}' needs
